{#
  Bill Pay — Scene gallery 2. Second, independent instance of the
  scene-gallery pattern (see scene-gallery.njk / assets/scene-gallery/
  bill-pay/scenes.html for the first) — a grey/green two-panel
  composition that panel-swaps between two scenes, the green panel
  bleeding to the viewport's right edge. Per "Gallery 2 — Scene 1 build
  spec": does not modify or share code with Gallery 1's files.

  Entire visual composition (grey frame, green panel, tag, caption,
  mock) lives inside assets/scene-gallery/bill-pay/scenes-gallery-2.html
  — this partial only provides the iframe stage (sized/bled to the
  viewport edge by scene-gallery-2.css) and the shared progress row.

  Standalone component — no section wrapper, no headline, no
  background. Caller drops {{ sceneGallery2() }} into its own content
  column.
#}
{% from "gallery-navigation.njk" import galleryInteraction %}

{% macro sceneGallery2() %}
<div class="scene-gallery-2">
  <div class="scene-gallery-2__stage">
    <iframe class="scene-gallery-2__visual" id="scene-gallery-2-visual" title="Bill Pay scene"></iframe>
  </div>
  <div class="scene-gallery-2__navigation">
    {{ galleryInteraction("scene-gallery-2") }}
  </div>
</div>
{% endmacro %}
